  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Framycetin is an antibiotic (bactericidal) used against bacterial infections, applied topically in medicated dressings, nasal preparations, and eye drops. It is an approved drug, used mainly in topical preparations for the skin, nose, and eyes.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4492348&quot;>Wikidata Q4492348</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>framycetin</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>D09AA01, R01AX08, S01AA07</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB00452&quot;>DB00452</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/8378&quot;>8378</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:7508&quot;>7508</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4492348&quot;>Q4492348</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C23H46N6O13</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>614.65 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
